	(text "R : protect overtensions\n+R better protection but slower\n-R faster but less protection\ntmiller = Qgd/Ig\ne.g : G current = 200mA\ntmiller = 72 ns\nPg,tot,max = Qg*Vgs*Fpwm = 0.182W\n\nDiodes : \nrapid discharge by short-circuiting the resistor"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 194.31 115.57 0)
