	(text "Tension measurement :\nVphase,max = 26.4 V\nVadc,max = Vphase,max/(Rhigh+Rlow) = 1.148V\nSTM : 0V - 3.3V\n\nReq = R36 || R37 = 956.5\nfc = 1/(2pi*Req*C) = 166.32 kHz\ntau = 0.95 us\n\nPr = C*(Vadc,max**2)*Fpwm,max = 0.13 mW"
