	(text "R shunt :\ncurrent calculation\nI = U/R, P = R*I**2\nI = 15A -> Prshunt = 0.1125W\nI = 100A -> Prshunt = 5W\n\nVso = 1.65 + G*I*R\nG = (5,10,20,40) (DRV 8353)\nTi recommand Vso = 0.25-3.05 V\nG = 20 and I = +-100 \n-> Vso = 0.65-2.65\nless R -> high current\n\nCshunt : \nattnuate noise\n"
